WEBVTT

01:31.090 --> 01:34.875
[Episode 32]

01:35.336 --> 01:38.176
Jinxia Pass is a strategic location.

01:38.176 --> 01:42.375
If it falls, the Beijian cavalry
can advance unhindered.

01:42.495 --> 01:43.976
We'll defend it with our lives.

01:43.976 --> 01:45.135
It must not fall.

01:45.135 --> 01:47.215
Report!

01:50.434 --> 01:52.855
Emergency!
Beijian forces have raided Jinxia Pass.

01:52.855 --> 01:55.256
Beijian's ambition is truly wolfish.

01:55.256 --> 01:57.616
They dared to reroute their main force.

01:57.616 --> 01:59.785
General Di, our army has very few troops left

01:59.785 --> 02:01.255
to defend Jinxia Pass.

02:01.255 --> 02:03.296
His Majesty is stationed a hundred li away.

02:03.296 --> 02:04.695
Light the beacon fires,

02:04.695 --> 02:07.336
and reinforcements will arrive
within four hours at most.

02:07.336 --> 02:09.616
Our forces are vastly outnumbered by Beijian.

02:09.616 --> 02:11.095
I'm afraid we can't last four hours.

02:11.095 --> 02:12.975
We are outnumbered,

02:12.975 --> 02:14.975
so we must attack instead of defend.

02:14.975 --> 02:16.535
Send the order!

02:16.535 --> 02:19.616
Light the beacons and follow me into battle!

02:19.616 --> 02:21.616
Yes!

02:28.456 --> 02:30.535
The beacons warn of a crisis at Jinxia Pass.

02:30.535 --> 02:33.296
- Get my horse!
- Yes!

02:57.215 --> 03:01.176
Today, our army shall crush Jinxia Pass!

03:01.176 --> 03:03.767
- Dream on!
- Kill!

03:04.252 --> 03:07.375
Kill!

04:08.215 --> 04:10.215
Huo An!

04:16.906 --> 04:23.122
[Zhi Li]

04:26.656 --> 04:30.015
<i>Zhi Li, happy birthday.</i>

04:30.135 --> 04:32.135
<i>You've grown another year older,</i>

04:32.616 --> 04:34.695
<i>and I've grown taller than you.</i>

04:34.695 --> 04:37.015
<i>From now on, I can always protect you.</i>

04:37.015 --> 04:40.976
<i>And don't call me
little brother anymore, alright?</i>

04:40.976 --> 04:44.056
[Zhi Li]

04:44.056 --> 04:47.135
<i>Zhi Li, happy birthday.</i>

04:47.135 --> 04:49.255
<i>You asked me my wish.</i>

04:49.455 --> 04:53.536
<i>I want to say, from the day
I entered the Shen Mansion,</i>

04:53.536 --> 04:56.135
<i>my wish has never changed.</i>

04:56.375 --> 04:58.416
<i>I want to tell you</i>

04:59.416 --> 05:01.416
<i>that I like you a lot.</i>

05:01.695 --> 05:03.736
<i>I really do.</i>

05:07.455 --> 05:09.536
Nian,

05:09.536 --> 05:11.536
wait for me.

05:12.176 --> 05:16.096
I have so many things to tell you.

05:48.335 --> 05:51.096
I found this while searching the valleys.

05:51.096 --> 05:54.176
I heard that carrying it brings good luck.

05:54.176 --> 05:56.255
I think you are the one
who needs some good luck.

05:56.255 --> 05:58.405
Zhi Li,

05:58.405 --> 05:59.656
will you marry me?

05:59.656 --> 06:01.656
Do you really not care at all

06:02.296 --> 06:04.176
about what happened?

06:04.176 --> 06:05.375
I don't care at all.

06:05.375 --> 06:08.736
Then do you know the knot in my heart

06:08.736 --> 06:11.856
<i>can't be undone by a simple 'I don't care'?</i>

06:15.135 --> 06:17.536
<i>Zhi Li, now,</i>

06:17.536 --> 06:19.856
do you like me even a little?

06:30.895 --> 06:32.935
You said

06:33.096 --> 06:35.135
this peach wood brings good luck

06:35.135 --> 06:37.455
and protects the wearer.

06:37.935 --> 06:40.375
I want you to come back safely.

06:48.656 --> 06:50.656
Nian.

07:09.736 --> 07:14.255
Soldiers of Ning, hold the line!

07:31.616 --> 07:33.616
Nian!

07:36.495 --> 07:38.536
Nian?

07:39.895 --> 07:41.895
Nian.

07:47.776 --> 07:49.776
Your Majesty,

07:49.935 --> 07:51.935
I

07:52.176 --> 07:54.416
haven't failed my duty.

08:10.815 --> 08:13.056
All soldiers, heed the order!

08:13.056 --> 08:17.015
Slaughter every last Beijian barbarian

08:17.495 --> 08:21.255
and make them pay for our lost soldiers!

08:33.256 --> 08:35.016
Report! Great victory!

08:35.016 --> 08:36.377
Di Nian of Ning and First Prince of Beijian

08:36.377 --> 08:38.735
both died in battle at Jinxia Pass.

08:43.815 --> 08:46.376
Finally, this day has come.

08:46.615 --> 08:48.695
They're dead.

08:48.855 --> 08:51.095
Finally.

08:52.136 --> 08:54.136
Nian.

08:56.176 --> 08:58.176
Nian.

08:59.095 --> 09:00.855
Your Highness,

09:00.855 --> 09:02.855
I did what I promised you.

09:02.855 --> 09:08.095
Zhongwan has taken the realm
without losing a single soldier.

09:10.455 --> 09:12.455
Yin Qing,

09:15.136 --> 09:18.256
you worked with Nian for three years.

09:18.575 --> 09:21.376
How can you still laugh?

09:21.735 --> 09:24.056
Have you thought about

09:24.496 --> 09:26.896
what Zhi Li must feel right now?

09:26.896 --> 09:28.896
I told you,

09:29.735 --> 09:32.136
I am Shangguan Zhao,

09:32.296 --> 09:34.735
not Yin Qing.

09:39.935 --> 09:41.935
Fine.

09:43.776 --> 09:47.376
Then let's end all this as soon as possible.

09:58.016 --> 10:01.335
My lady, a letter from Qingzhou has arrived.

10:22.560 --> 10:25.753
[General Di died for the country]

10:36.855 --> 10:38.855
Nian.

10:39.575 --> 10:40.611
Nian.

10:40.611 --> 10:45.001
[Died for the country]

10:49.776 --> 10:51.855
Nian!

11:22.975 --> 11:27.176
I have brought you
the head of Beijian's First Prince.

11:27.176 --> 11:30.496
Thank you
for wiping out the Beijian royals for me.

11:30.496 --> 11:34.095
Today, I am here by order
of Zhongwan's Empress Murong Yao

11:34.095 --> 11:35.815
to take your head.

11:35.815 --> 11:37.575
Shangguan Zhao,

11:37.575 --> 11:39.935
I once let you live,

11:39.935 --> 11:41.455
and I can send you to your doom.

11:41.455 --> 11:43.016
Shangguan Zhao!

11:43.016 --> 11:46.656
Nian's blood debt will be paid in blood!

11:47.016 --> 11:49.615
All soldiers, heed the order!

11:58.136 --> 12:00.136
Stop!

12:20.176 --> 12:22.176
I, Murong Yao,

12:22.776 --> 12:25.935
the last royal blood of Zhongwan,

12:25.935 --> 12:29.176
order all Zhongwan troops
to lay down their weapons!

12:29.176 --> 12:31.176
Your Highness, no!

12:35.416 --> 12:37.416
Yin Qing,

12:37.935 --> 12:40.496
your obsession is restoring the kingdom.

12:40.896 --> 12:43.016
But my obsession

12:43.335 --> 12:45.776
is to let the Zhongwan people
live in peace and prosperity

12:45.776 --> 12:47.735
and no longer be displaced.

12:47.735 --> 12:49.656
Soldiers of Zhongwan,

12:49.656 --> 12:51.215
if war breaks out today,

12:51.215 --> 12:53.335
Zhongwan will be the first to suffer,

12:53.335 --> 12:56.496
and our neighbors
will take advantage and attack.

12:56.615 --> 12:59.575
Do you want to restore our kingdom

13:00.455 --> 13:02.855
or destroy the world?

13:09.896 --> 13:13.975
Ying Gua, your father
killed my father and mother

13:13.975 --> 13:15.815
and destroyed my homeland.

13:15.815 --> 13:18.136
I should hate you to the bone,

13:18.136 --> 13:21.815
yet in the end,
I can't even bring myself to blame you.

13:21.815 --> 13:26.455
Because I know you also don't want
to see the realm in ruin.

13:26.455 --> 13:28.776
You are using your own way

13:29.215 --> 13:32.776
to resolve the years of hatred
between our two nations.

13:32.776 --> 13:35.575
Can we ever be even?

13:42.575 --> 13:45.455
You can't even bring yourself to stab me.

13:45.615 --> 13:48.056
How can I believe what you said?

13:48.776 --> 13:51.256
I know well how hard it is for you.

13:51.615 --> 13:53.615
But rest assured.

13:53.735 --> 13:56.615
No matter what choice you make,

13:57.176 --> 13:59.455
I will support you.

14:08.416 --> 14:12.615
Beijian will sneak attack Xigu Pass
in three days.

14:12.615 --> 14:15.896
The arrows will be poisoned,
causing instant death.

14:15.896 --> 14:18.056
I have never doubted you.

14:18.056 --> 14:21.496
There will no longer be Ning and Zhongwan
on Ning's registers.

14:21.496 --> 14:23.545
This land

14:23.710 --> 14:26.656
belongs to all who dwell in it.

14:30.256 --> 14:32.615
The new policy for Zhongwan is here.

14:32.615 --> 14:35.016
The perpetual servitude law is no more.

14:35.016 --> 14:38.536
From this day forward,
slaves are freed and granted land

14:38.536 --> 14:40.296
and may serve and enlist.

14:40.296 --> 14:43.776
This is the true path
for the Zhongwan people.

14:44.136 --> 14:47.095
Mr. Shangguan,
our survivors have been pardoned.

14:47.095 --> 14:49.975
From now on,
there will be no more Wannu Camp.

14:51.136 --> 14:54.296
Your Highness,
Ning is treacherous and cannot be trusted.

14:54.296 --> 14:56.815
When the Ning cavalry
trampled the Zhongwan capital,

14:56.815 --> 14:58.695
did they show any mercy?

14:58.695 --> 15:00.855
From this day forward...

15:04.056 --> 15:06.136
Your Majesty.

15:06.136 --> 15:08.376
I swear by the blood of the emperor,

15:08.376 --> 15:12.095
in the household registers,
there will only be Ning subjects

15:12.095 --> 15:14.455
and no more distinction
between Zhongwan and Ning.

15:14.455 --> 15:18.335
If I break this oath,
may the realm forsake me.

15:18.575 --> 15:20.855
Meng Ting Hui, I hereby promise

15:20.855 --> 15:23.935
all of Zhongwan's former lands are yours,

15:23.935 --> 15:27.536
and Zhongwan will become
a state within a state.

15:27.536 --> 15:29.416
Your Highness,

15:29.416 --> 15:32.215
Ying Gua only wants to claim you and Zhongwan
and make it look justified.

15:32.215 --> 15:34.735
But what I want to give you
is the entire world

15:34.735 --> 15:38.536
and make you the first empress in history.

15:41.416 --> 15:42.935
Ying Gua,

15:42.935 --> 15:45.776
I will reclaim the lost lands of Zhongwan
with my sword.

15:45.776 --> 15:47.855
We don't need your charity!

15:47.855 --> 15:49.496
Zhongwan soldiers, heed my command!

15:49.496 --> 15:53.575
Kill all the Ning dogs and restore our land!

16:03.935 --> 16:07.056
Mr. Shangguan, stop being so willfully blind.

16:07.056 --> 16:10.855
Yin Qing, give up.

16:15.735 --> 16:18.376
I have waited for so many years

16:19.256 --> 16:21.776
and planned for a lifetime.

16:25.215 --> 16:28.855
Today, even if I am the only one
left of Zhongwan,

16:29.376 --> 16:32.575
I will never give up.

16:49.815 --> 16:51.815
Meng Ting Hui!

16:59.615 --> 17:03.575
Since Your Highness wants
to return to Ning so much,

17:04.056 --> 17:06.415
then I will grant your wish.

17:06.575 --> 17:07.575
Shangguan Zhao!

17:07.575 --> 17:09.575
Your Highness!

17:14.615 --> 17:16.615
Mr. Shangguan!

17:19.016 --> 17:21.016
Miss Meng,

17:21.936 --> 17:24.895
you've killed the greatest sinner of Ning.

17:24.895 --> 17:27.335
Now go back to Ning.

17:33.895 --> 17:35.016
Fire!

17:35.016 --> 17:37.016
No!

17:48.175 --> 17:50.175
Mr. Shangguan!

18:05.335 --> 18:09.016
Forget Shangguan.

18:11.776 --> 18:16.095
Just remember Yin Qing.

18:17.696 --> 18:19.696
Miss Meng,

18:23.855 --> 18:26.415
I see

18:28.095 --> 18:30.776
a rainbow.

18:34.696 --> 18:36.175
Miss Meng.

18:36.175 --> 18:37.776
You are?

18:37.776 --> 18:39.175
I am Yin Qing.

18:39.175 --> 18:41.895
With my years of experience
traveling the world,

18:41.895 --> 18:44.135
roaming all the great mountains,

18:44.135 --> 18:47.095
and having read extensively...

18:49.655 --> 18:53.855
Because you two are naturally beautiful!

18:54.855 --> 18:57.536
What position was I promoted to again?

18:58.375 --> 19:00.855
Judge Yin.

19:02.776 --> 19:05.095
No matter how great the storms in this world,

19:05.095 --> 19:07.536
they will eventually cease one day.

19:07.536 --> 19:10.895
Yin Qing, thank you.

19:10.895 --> 19:12.696
Miss Meng,

19:12.696 --> 19:16.536
as long as I am here,
I will definitely keep you safe.

19:18.335 --> 19:20.415
Shangguan.

19:25.736 --> 19:28.256
Shangguan.

19:31.296 --> 19:34.536
Shangguan!

19:43.415 --> 19:46.135
Shangguan.

19:58.936 --> 20:01.575
Don't leave.

20:01.776 --> 20:03.815
Don't.

20:14.216 --> 20:16.216
Mr. Shangguan,

20:18.335 --> 20:20.855
I'll accompany you.

20:29.016 --> 20:31.175
Situ Xue.

22:04.655 --> 22:07.175
Meng? Meng, you're awake!

22:07.175 --> 22:08.936
Are you hungry? Do you want to eat something?

22:08.936 --> 22:10.936
Do you want some water?

22:13.175 --> 22:15.175
Here.

22:15.375 --> 22:16.496
You're finally back.

22:16.496 --> 22:19.496
I thought I would never see you again.

22:20.095 --> 22:22.375
The war is over.

22:23.655 --> 22:26.815
Now we can finally spend time together.

22:28.175 --> 22:33.175
I also want to see you
open Bofeng House all over the realm.

22:34.016 --> 22:36.256
Now, the soldiers of Ning
all respect and honor you.

22:36.256 --> 22:38.776
No one will dare doubt your identity anymore.

22:38.776 --> 22:41.256
Zhi Shu and I have reconciled as well.

22:41.256 --> 22:43.976
I think this is the best outcome, isn't it?

22:43.976 --> 22:46.776
Mr. Shen treats you with utmost sincerity.

22:47.016 --> 22:49.976
Seeing you have such a good man by your side

22:49.976 --> 22:52.095
puts my heart at ease.

22:52.095 --> 22:54.016
Isn't it the same for you?

22:54.016 --> 22:56.736
You and His Majesty.

22:58.575 --> 23:00.575
Fu Zhi,

23:03.456 --> 23:05.776
for some reason,

23:06.216 --> 23:10.016
I've been thinking about that old tree
at the Shazhou Women's Academy lately.

23:10.016 --> 23:12.175
I also keep thinking
about apricot skin cakes.

23:12.175 --> 23:14.615
Then I'll make some for you right now.

23:14.855 --> 23:16.615
What's wrong?

23:16.615 --> 23:19.575
This is a military camp.
Where would you get the ingredients?

23:19.575 --> 23:20.615
As long as you want it,

23:20.615 --> 23:21.736
even if it's reaching for the moon,

23:21.736 --> 23:23.335
I will get it for you.

23:23.335 --> 23:24.575
Wait for me.

23:24.575 --> 23:26.575
I will.

23:35.216 --> 23:37.415
Look at what I made this time...

23:39.296 --> 23:41.296
Meng?

23:52.704 --> 23:55.496
[To Your Majesty, from Meng Ting Hui]

24:06.375 --> 24:08.615
<i>Your Majesty,</i>

24:08.615 --> 24:12.456
<i>the realm as a betrothal gift
is your promise,</i>

24:12.976 --> 24:16.815
<i>while offering my remaining years
to the land is my duty</i>

24:16.815 --> 24:19.335
<i>and also my way of loving you.</i>

24:20.296 --> 24:23.895
<i>The dust has settled. I shall take my leave</i>

24:23.895 --> 24:26.496
<i>so as not to let you and me down.</i>

24:27.095 --> 24:30.016
<i>I only worry about Zhi Li and Fu Zhi.</i>

24:30.415 --> 24:34.335
<i>Zhi Li lost Nian, and her heart is broken.</i>

24:34.335 --> 24:38.655
<i>Fu Zhi burns like fire,
and fire can turn on itself.</i>

24:38.936 --> 24:40.736
<i>I hope you and Zhi Shu</i>

24:40.736 --> 24:43.776
<i>will protect them for a lifetime
on my behalf.</i>

24:43.776 --> 24:47.736
<i>This is my last selfish wish.</i>

24:48.296 --> 24:50.696
<i>I'll take away my exhaustion,</i>

24:50.696 --> 24:52.575
<i>leaving behind a vast, clear sky.</i>

24:52.575 --> 24:54.895
<i>This is fulfillment.</i>

24:55.056 --> 24:56.976
<i>May you rule over the four seas,</i>

24:56.976 --> 24:58.615
<i>guard the endless land,</i>

24:58.615 --> 25:01.415
<i>and be a great ruler for all time.</i>

25:01.696 --> 25:04.575
<i>May I always be the Meng Ting Hui</i>

25:04.575 --> 25:08.016
<i>who discussed politics with you
under the lamp in the Censorate.</i>

25:08.415 --> 25:11.936
<i>And may every night thereafter,
when you review memorials,</i>

25:11.936 --> 25:16.776
<i>the candle before your desk always be warm.</i>

25:31.776 --> 25:35.395
[Three years later]

25:57.736 --> 25:59.736
Di An?

26:02.415 --> 26:04.415
Di An?

26:09.496 --> 26:11.496
Mother.

26:12.855 --> 26:14.855
Di An.

26:19.936 --> 26:22.655
How can you fool around before the throne?

26:26.752 --> 26:30.496
Mom, I'm better than my father.

26:30.815 --> 26:33.415
Then you must first train hard.

26:44.936 --> 26:48.976
Mom, why do you like Father?

26:56.296 --> 26:58.296
Zhi Li.

27:12.216 --> 27:14.536
I don't just like him.

27:15.216 --> 27:17.296
I love him.

27:17.575 --> 27:19.575
But it's too late.

27:22.016 --> 27:24.016
Di An.

27:25.615 --> 27:27.895
Uncle.

27:36.060 --> 27:38.016
Good boy, I'll take you
to the training ground

27:38.016 --> 27:40.536
to see where your father used to train.

27:45.422 --> 27:48.815
Uncle, I want to be a great general

27:49.496 --> 27:52.976
to protect Mother and His Majesty.

28:02.496 --> 28:04.820
Great!

28:04.820 --> 28:08.976
[Bofeng House]
Great!

28:08.976 --> 28:11.855
Great!

28:12.095 --> 28:13.095
Ms. Yan,

28:13.095 --> 28:14.976
now that the imperial merchant plaque
is hung,

28:14.976 --> 28:18.575
we are the most honored
among all 72 merchant houses of the capital.

28:18.895 --> 28:20.216
This is just the beginning.

28:20.216 --> 28:23.456
I'll open branches of Bofeng House
all over Ning.

28:23.456 --> 28:26.335
I'm going to Xuzhou and Bianzhou
to check on new shop locations.

28:26.335 --> 28:29.976
I'll leave the twelve branches
in the capital to all of you.

28:29.976 --> 28:30.976
Yes.

28:30.976 --> 28:33.936
Ms. Yan!

28:33.936 --> 28:35.256
What great news!

28:35.256 --> 28:37.575
I heard that Mr. Shen
has achieved another great merit,

28:37.575 --> 28:39.776
and he's about to be promoted
to a higher rank.

28:39.776 --> 28:43.375
With such good fortune,
why are you bothering with branches?

28:44.415 --> 28:46.615
It's precisely because
they are all in the clouds

28:46.615 --> 28:50.655
that I need to pave the roads
on the ground more extensively.

28:51.375 --> 28:53.375
Let's go.

28:53.736 --> 28:56.976
We see you off, Ms. Yan.

28:58.135 --> 29:00.335
- Safe journey!
- Good luck!

29:02.456 --> 29:04.375
Congratulations.

29:04.375 --> 29:06.375
Have a smooth journey.

29:22.335 --> 29:24.976
Above, a wise ruler bestows his grace.

29:24.976 --> 29:28.496
Above, a wise ruler bestows his grace.

29:28.496 --> 29:31.016
Below, virtuous ministers give their all.

29:31.016 --> 29:33.736
Below, virtuous ministers give their all.

29:33.736 --> 29:35.815
Only then can the land be governed.

29:35.815 --> 29:38.256
Only then can the land be governed.

29:38.256 --> 29:40.016
The people nurtured.

29:40.016 --> 29:41.936
The people nurtured.

29:41.936 --> 29:43.615
And peace secured.

29:43.615 --> 29:45.815
And peace secured.

29:45.815 --> 29:48.335
If I can help the people with my life,

29:48.335 --> 29:51.335
[Shazhou Women's Academy]
I will not spare it.

30:36.095 --> 30:39.016
You disguised yourself as Situ Xue
to deceive the people

30:39.016 --> 30:41.335
and concealed weapons with malicious intent.

30:41.335 --> 30:42.855
By law, you should be exiled.

30:42.855 --> 30:45.415
On what grounds do you say I'm fake?

30:52.016 --> 30:55.056
You are selfish and full of lies.

30:55.056 --> 30:57.056
After being exposed, you try to argue.

30:57.056 --> 30:59.456
You're good at playing innocent and pitiful.

30:59.456 --> 31:01.895
You're so cunning, deceitful,
and duplicitous.

31:01.895 --> 31:04.776
How do I know you are not deceiving me?

31:06.456 --> 31:09.895
You really have a deep impression of me.

31:27.936 --> 31:29.936
We meet again,

31:29.936 --> 31:31.976
Miss Meng.

31:35.335 --> 31:37.415
With your power and influence,

31:37.415 --> 31:39.256
instead of going
after the Heihu Crew and Ding Chong,

31:39.256 --> 31:43.296
you waste your time on a helpless woman.
Some ability that is.

31:43.296 --> 31:47.415
If you deceive me, you'll be dead.

31:47.536 --> 31:51.536
Since I brought you in,
I won't let anything happen to you.

31:52.135 --> 31:56.415
A master like you is afraid of a small snake?

32:00.815 --> 32:03.296
At least treat me to a meal first.

32:13.815 --> 32:15.815
Miss Meng,

32:16.936 --> 32:18.815
until we meet again.

32:18.815 --> 32:22.655
If fate allows, we will meet again.

32:26.655 --> 32:28.895
I think He Du in Shazhou

32:28.895 --> 32:33.175
was more interesting than Your Majesty.

32:35.855 --> 32:38.615
Mr. He, warm soup is good for the stomach.

32:38.615 --> 32:41.095
Is the lamb soup good?

32:41.696 --> 32:44.895
Good, very good.

32:44.895 --> 32:47.375
It's just like the one in Shazhou.

32:47.375 --> 32:50.536
Spicy and fierce.

33:17.696 --> 33:22.335
You walked step by step right up to me.

33:30.776 --> 33:32.976
The boy.

33:34.095 --> 33:35.936
He Du.

33:35.936 --> 33:37.936
The emperor.

33:38.415 --> 33:41.252
Over ten years, you have witnessed my life

33:41.252 --> 33:43.655
under different identities.

33:45.456 --> 33:48.056
Why wait for snow to make a wish?

33:48.415 --> 33:51.016
I can fulfill your wishes.

33:53.415 --> 33:56.936
I also hope the Ning Empire
will be peaceful and prosperous.

33:56.936 --> 34:00.216
I hope that next year,

34:00.216 --> 34:02.376
I will still have old friends by my side.

34:04.695 --> 34:06.735
When spring comes,

34:06.735 --> 34:08.816
shall we release floating lanterns together?

34:08.816 --> 34:10.896
It's a promise.

35:16.976 --> 35:18.976
Your Majesty!

35:31.695 --> 35:33.695
Meng Ting Hui,

35:34.376 --> 35:36.456
let's get married.

35:45.792 --> 35:50.064
[Censorate]

35:57.976 --> 36:01.376
<i>Three years have passed.
The Ning Empire misses you.</i>

36:01.775 --> 36:04.575
<i>Now, the storms in the court
have not yet ceased.</i>

36:05.215 --> 36:07.976
<i>Will you walk with me again?</i>
